<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-04T22:01:13.688Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 22:01:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Algerian forces have entered Niger to protect energy interests, joining other state actors in the Sahel insurgency. Islamist militants abducted 14 Islamic school students in Niger State, while bandits in the same state demanded over ₦100 million ransom for the abductees. Gunmen attacked a market in north-central Nigeria, killing four civilians and wounding five. A Russian electronic-warfare vehicle was observed operating in Mali. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE81b2FCcWxBcHZ6WFNUZldUZUVTOWcxeGlEYUlYY0d6OElTbTdwbXFIdWs1c1cxcFVCcWJMc09oNnlyYmlVbXRvekhodFFHWTQ4N3FtdDgxUXl0ZUhuWVRfbXI3OGt3SDJxcmVYUm1ndHNjbmk0VUx2cjRqb1pTdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOWFhRcUN1dVBpMWFQZFR3a3FMWG54YkJGNlZMY3N2MHlzYjVUWVVSNnZPaEVHQkJBNjVGUFloeTNXdGVDd2JyTFdraEZldEMzd0tzMzFUS18zSkVPYXdJXzAtNnZPQXZLQmJDSHNUSkdqNkktOE9lMVBkQllXZl9XdGdnZ3FXcHROMFE0YWg4eTNBcjNUaEtOOGJnc0IwUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE5peTdlTVJZUmV2VGxCcklqTjVidnBSSW9fZERqREgtbE84dnJRR1RDTVF4aHJ2c2tscmlyeE9KTEhuYTQzeE4xclZtcXlOOXhmX2Vzd2dWcWZkVHBGN0h1bkVOTXliRU8zSy1J?oc=5&quot;&gt;allAfrica.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPd2FGQzZfOV9VcGRhUHEzVmVLX2NpdEpzcGh5QzlHTUpub0N5ODJNb3lQN1VGYlVRT1hPVkR4SGFiM1JmcXlxV2lmYll4ZVd2S3RBTllOM012eHJuX1ZlSHhMOUNFTWM3OGF3QUFwZndnVnUtc0dnRlpkMVZ6NEVvWFpGOHZrSDJQZnUxaTRmU0NXNlYyVldCTkF3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Defence Blog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOVUJaRHBjb1NjZnp6YUpzNzhzbjhaY3FucjBnaW9DR2VwVD